<th id="S4.T1.3.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="S4.T1.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Diag Score (Mean <math id="S4.T1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> Std) <math id="S4.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></th>
