</section>
<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Hyperparameters, Tuning and Computational Resources</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We tune the hyperparameters by random search allocating <math id="A2.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>50</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">50</annotation></semantics></math> samples to each method and each configuration run with <math id="A2.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5</annotation></semantics></math> different seeds. Tables <a href="#A2.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ B.3 Hyperparameters, Tuning and Computational Resources ‣ Appendix B Extended Empirical Results ‣ From Pixels to Factors:Learning Independently Controllable State Variables for Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, <a href="#A2.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ B.3 Hyperparameters, Tuning and Computational Resources ‣ Appendix B Extended Empirical Results ‣ From Pixels to Factors:Learning Independently Controllable State Variables for Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ B.3 Hyperparameters, Tuning and Computational Resources ‣ Appendix B Extended Empirical Results ‣ From Pixels to Factors:Learning Independently Controllable State Variables for Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, and <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ B.3 Hyperparameters, Tuning and Computational Resources ‣ Appendix B Extended Empirical Results ‣ From Pixels to Factors:Learning Independently Controllable State Variables for Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> show the details for the best results for all methods and domains.
Each trial was run in a NVIDIA GeForce RTX3090 24GB. Each trial took 15min. All experiments used <math id="A2.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="150K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">150K</annotation></semantics></math> transitions.</p>
</div>
