<section id="A2.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.4 </span>Detailed Empirical Results</h3>

<div id="A2.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Detailed results for DoorKey (Figure <a href="#A2.F5.sf2" title="In Figure 5 ‣ B.4 Detailed Empirical Results ‣ Appendix B Extended Empirical Results ‣ From Pixels to Factors:Learning Independently Controllable State Variables for Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5(b)</span></a>), Minigrid-FourRooms (Figure <a href="#A2.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ B.4 Detailed Empirical Results ‣ Appendix B Extended Empirical Results ‣ From Pixels to Factors:Learning Independently Controllable State Variables for Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>), Taxi (Figure <a href="#A2.F7.sf2" title="In Figure 7 ‣ B.4 Detailed Empirical Results ‣ Appendix B Extended Empirical Results ‣ From Pixels to Factors:Learning Independently Controllable State Variables for Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7(b)</span></a>), and Grid2D (Figure <a href="#A2.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ B.4 Detailed Empirical Results ‣ Appendix B Extended Empirical Results ‣ From Pixels to Factors:Learning Independently Controllable State Variables for Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>).</p>
</div>
